        <groundspeak:log id="617497730">
          <groundspeak:date>2016-07-10T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="2500583">Count Smiley</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP670 Two Hills

We made quick work of finding and getting the information from the cap and thought that Two Hills would be a good place to do the 'travelers rest stop' thing only to find out that the storm that just went through took out the power and nobody was doing business.  Good thing we weren't too low on anything so we headed off toward Vegreville.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
